      "text": "Auto-unseal on restart\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSet VAULT_UNSEAL_KEY env var with a full share (when shares=1 it IS the MEK).\nVault reads env on startup and unseals automatically \u2014 no manual intervention.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "info",
      "originalText": "Auto-unseal on restart\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSet VAULT_UNSEAL_KEY env var with a full share (when shares=1 it IS the MEK).\nVault reads env on startup and unseals automatically \u2014 no manual intervention.",
